00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:58.520
This afternoon I visited the Holocaust Museum
Holocaust, and there's nothing where it happened.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:03.200
Unidentified: You know, over six million Jewish
people were murdered.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:08.350
More than that,
Speaker 2: there were not just Jewish people,

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:14.640
